{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01195",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 7.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.17,
      "end_seconds": 13.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 17.14,
      "end_seconds": 22.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.4,
      "end_seconds": 27.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 29.78,
      "end_seconds": 33.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "She's been having a stiff painful shoulder, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.64,
      "end_seconds": 38.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 39.16,
      "end_seconds": 57.02,
      "duration_seconds": 17.86,
      "text": "Yeah, she takes glibenclamide, 5 milligrams, before breakfast for my sugar. Sorry, uh, what was I saying, she is on ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, when needed, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.78,
      "end_seconds": 66.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.74,
      "end_seconds": 89.02,
      "duration_seconds": 17.28,
      "text": "Right, it's been going on for two days. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.03,
      "end_seconds": 99.38,
      "duration_seconds": 9.35,
      "text": "Okay, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.16,
      "end_seconds": 112.96,
      "duration_seconds": 11.8,
      "text": "I'd give it a eight, out of ten. Rest helps a bit. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.75,
      "end_seconds": 118.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Okay, has there been not being able to lift your arm too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.41,
      "end_seconds": 129.96,
      "duration_seconds": 10.55,
      "text": "Yes, uh, actually. Actually, about not being able to lift my arm, pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.49,
      "end_seconds": 145.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fall, numbness or neck pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.93,
      "end_seconds": 150.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.8,
      "end_seconds": 157.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.7,
      "end_seconds": 164.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Um, um, no, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.94,
      "end_seconds": 167.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Right, any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.49,
      "end_seconds": 173.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Hmm, nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.78,
      "end_seconds": 177.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.0,
      "end_seconds": 186.14,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "Yes, I had my appendix taken out, when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.99,
      "end_seconds": 190.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Okay, do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.61,
      "end_seconds": 198.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Erm, um, I've had diabetes for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.5,
      "end_seconds": 209.61,
      "duration_seconds": 9.11,
      "text": "Right, right. Right, so diabetes is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.39,
      "end_seconds": 220.42,
      "duration_seconds": 10.03,
      "text": "I had a reaction to tramadol when I was younger, vomiting, and I've avoided it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.16,
      "end_seconds": 222.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.38,
      "end_seconds": 227.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.67,
      "end_seconds": 231.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.93,
      "end_seconds": 235.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.86,
      "end_seconds": 240.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.65,
      "end_seconds": 254.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.2,
      "end_seconds": 281.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.11,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.8 degrees, saturation 98 percent. And pulse 82, pressure 116 over 79."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.36,
      "end_seconds": 286.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.02,
      "end_seconds": 290.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.69,
      "end_seconds": 309.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Movement is limited in all directions, both active and passive."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.38,
      "end_seconds": 313.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.59,
      "end_seconds": 319.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.24,
      "end_seconds": 337.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.85,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. I think we're dealing with adhesive capsulitis, a frozen shoulder at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.7,
      "end_seconds": 341.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.35,
      "end_seconds": 365.37,
      "duration_seconds": 23.02,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like adhesive capsulitis, a frozen shoulder, but I'd like to confirm. An X-ray of the shoulder is what I'd like next, for shoulder pain. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.17,
      "end_seconds": 370.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Oh, do I need to prepare?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.75,
      "end_seconds": 393.46,
      "duration_seconds": 21.71,
      "text": "Gentle daily stretches within comfort, and heat before them. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Book a review in six weeks. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.99,
      "end_seconds": 398.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 399.55,
      "end_seconds": 400.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}